  "item_short_desc": "<p>Rothco&rsquo;s Camo Headwrap offers versatile protection and comfort for a variety of outdoor activities. Crafted from lightweight woven cotton, this camouflage headwrap is perfect for absorbing sweat and shielding your head from the sun. Whether you&rsquo;re a hunter, biker, construction worker, or simply enjoying the outdoors, the camo headwrap can be worn alone or under other headwear, including tactical helmets. Available in multiple camouflage patterns, it&rsquo;s a practical accessory that adapts to your needs.</p>",
  "no_ratings": "0",
